    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Less tired; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tingling in the left fingertips, less than before; Lhermitte&apos;s sign fainter; no new symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>Throat itch with the first infusion only</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rash</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Hopeful; PHQ-9 5; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

